3861
04:04:38,900 --> 04:04:40,060
Holy crap.

3862
04:04:51,970 --> 04:04:53,690
Steward take damage from freezing?

3863
04:04:53,910 --> 04:04:54,370
He does.

3864
04:05:06,830 --> 04:05:07,170
Come on.

3865
04:05:07,350 --> 04:05:11,110
Dude, I'm actually so relieved that we have made peace.

3866
04:05:13,670 --> 04:05:15,210
It's such a nice perk.

3867
04:05:30,540 --> 04:05:31,500
A bit more blood.

3868
04:05:31,860 --> 04:05:32,280
There we go.

3869
04:05:34,840 --> 04:05:36,000
Unstable polymorphine.

3870
04:05:36,520 --> 04:05:36,600
Yeah.

3871
04:05:40,400 --> 04:05:40,780
Nope.

3872
04:05:43,740 --> 04:05:44,500
Keep going right.

3873
04:05:51,820 --> 04:05:52,620
He's burning alive.

3874
04:05:54,760 --> 04:05:55,360
That's lovely.

3875
04:06:12,520 --> 04:06:13,900
Looks like steward is sort of stuck.

3876
04:06:33,260 --> 04:06:34,180
I'm sorry, did I hit you, steward?

3877
04:06:34,640 --> 04:06:35,260
Did I hit you a little bit?

3878
04:06:38,870 --> 04:06:39,850
All right, we're at the edge.

3879
04:06:40,930 --> 04:06:41,610
That means we're close.

3880
04:06:43,950 --> 04:06:44,390
Wait a minute.

3881
04:06:46,810 --> 04:06:47,710
Oh, that's right.

3882
04:06:53,130 --> 04:06:54,990
Huh, well, that kind of sucks.

3883
04:06:55,390 --> 04:06:56,750
Is this always here, by the way?

3884
04:06:58,530 --> 04:06:59,230
Yeah, it is.

3885
04:06:59,690 --> 04:07:00,670
There's stuff up there again.

3886
04:07:02,530 --> 04:07:04,150
So blood, I actually have blood.

3887
04:07:05,930 --> 04:07:07,510
There was actually something else I wanted to test.

3888
04:07:07,630 --> 04:07:08,390
I forgot what it was.

3889
04:07:11,860 --> 04:07:12,880
All right, let's get to the anvil.

3890
04:07:15,020 --> 04:07:15,360
Anvil.

3891
04:07:16,980 --> 04:07:17,380
Whoops.

3892
04:07:31,740 --> 04:07:32,100
Got it.

3893
04:07:36,080 --> 04:07:37,540
Fill up my blood flask.

3894
04:07:46,360 --> 04:07:47,560
Oh, man.

3895
04:07:49,520 --> 04:07:51,680
This game does produce some cool ass moments.

3896
04:07:55,840 --> 04:07:56,640
Wait, why am I taking damage?

3897
04:08:04,240 --> 04:08:04,900
Get more blood.

3898
04:08:17,220 --> 04:08:17,860
There it is.

3899
04:08:19,100 --> 04:08:19,380
Yep.

3900
04:08:20,740 --> 04:08:21,580
We made it.

3901
04:08:24,650 --> 04:08:25,250
