3902
04:08:29,000 --> 04:08:33,960
Liquid detonation converts nearby non-magical liquids into explosive gunpowder.

3903
04:08:36,400 --> 04:08:36,840
Jesus.

3904
04:08:37,840 --> 04:08:39,840
Yo, look at the mana max on this wand.

3905
04:08:41,160 --> 04:08:42,460
What the fuck?

3906
04:08:44,000 --> 04:08:44,780
That's a lot.

3907
04:08:47,560 --> 04:08:49,600
I think I like the sound of this.

3908
04:08:54,660 --> 04:08:56,260
