3911
04:09:10,690 --> 04:09:11,090
This one.

3912
04:09:13,130 --> 04:09:14,010
How many do I have left?

3913
04:09:14,970 --> 04:09:15,570
Two of them.

3914
04:09:16,230 --> 04:09:17,410
I don't need this right now.

3915
04:09:17,970 --> 04:09:18,770
