3916
04:09:20,250 --> 04:09:21,070
I want this.

3917
04:09:21,910 --> 04:09:22,130
Liquid detonation.

3918
04:09:24,330 --> 04:09:25,250
That seems fun.

3919
04:09:26,970 --> 04:09:28,310
Seems like a good time, doesn't it?

3920
04:09:29,190 --> 04:09:30,110
A good old time.

3921
04:09:36,840 --> 04:09:37,800
Release the toxic.

3922
04:09:38,760 --> 04:09:39,400
And make it water.

3923
04:09:41,640 --> 04:09:42,780
All that's going to be water.

3924
04:09:54,140 --> 04:09:54,700
