3925
04:09:58,470 --> 04:10:00,530
I see you.

3926
04:10:12,220 --> 04:10:13,120
Mix, mix, mix, mix, mix.

3927
04:10:24,580 --> 04:10:25,860
Wait, is there a worm here?

3928
04:10:39,160 --> 04:10:40,680
Feels like a worm has been here.

3929
04:10:45,760 --> 04:10:46,500
Oh, wait.

3930
04:10:46,740 --> 04:10:47,220
Ugozkivi?

3931
04:10:56,550 --> 04:10:57,290
I'm afraid.

3932
04:10:59,710 --> 04:11:00,790
No, it's still there.

3933
04:11:02,990 --> 04:11:04,170
What is causing that?

3934
04:11:08,220 --> 04:11:08,940
Yes, it is.

3935
04:11:09,180 --> 04:11:09,860
It's an Ugozkivi.

3936
04:11:10,060 --> 04:11:10,420
Fuck me.

3937
04:11:11,940 --> 04:11:13,180
Yeah, I don't want to go anywhere near that.

3938
04:11:13,220 --> 04:11:13,660
No!

3939
04:11:14,620 --> 04:11:16,180
Wow, I saw that last minute.

3940
04:11:20,890 --> 04:11:20,990
Scary.

3941
04:11:36,740 --> 04:11:37,980
I like my wand, man.

3942
04:11:38,260 --> 04:11:39,500
It's not, like, amazing.

3943
04:11:40,160 --> 04:11:41,340
But it's totally decent.

3944
04:11:43,600 --> 04:11:46,360
