3946
04:12:12,720 --> 04:12:13,800
Oh, oh, oh, oh.

3947
04:12:14,400 --> 04:12:14,800
Stop.

3948
04:12:17,520 --> 04:12:19,180
Stop spawning enemies.

3949
04:12:23,440 --> 04:12:25,140
Wait, is this an infinite gold farm?

3950
04:12:26,480 --> 04:12:28,440
If you keep spawning them, I keep killing them.

3951
04:12:30,040 --> 04:12:31,380
