3952
04:12:43,400 --> 04:12:43,960
Is that?

3953
04:12:44,240 --> 04:12:45,880
No, I thought it was a propane tank.

3954
04:12:55,740 --> 04:12:56,360
Blow it.

3955
04:12:59,780 --> 04:13:00,360
