3956
04:13:05,830 --> 04:13:07,710
Oh, I guess it's their arboretum.

3957
04:13:12,720 --> 04:13:13,240
Come here.

3958
04:13:30,440 --> 04:13:31,800
That was a friendo, but I don't care.

3959
04:13:32,780 --> 04:13:33,720
I don't give a fuck.

3960
04:13:36,920 --> 04:13:37,260
Wait, why am I?

3961
04:13:39,000 --> 04:13:40,000
Oh, shit, I'm out of water.

3962
04:13:41,440 --> 04:13:42,560
I really should fix that.

3963
04:13:54,160 --> 04:13:54,920
Produce more blood.

3964
04:13:57,480 --> 04:14:01,680
Oh, that is unstable polymorphine.

3965
04:14:13,440 --> 04:14:13,800
No!

3966
04:14:14,620 --> 04:14:15,320
Okay, thank God.

3967
04:14:19,230 --> 04:14:20,510
Didn't have to walk all the way around.

3968
04:14:21,030 --> 04:14:21,850
That would have been a disaster.

3969
04:14:29,270 --> 04:14:30,270
Oh, we're at the entrance?

3970
04:14:32,010 --> 04:14:32,450
Funny.

3971
04:14:44,060 --> 04:14:46,800
Man, the freezing vapor is really effective at killing enemies.

3972
04:14:47,160 --> 04:14:49,620
If they just walk through it, it lights out.

3973
04:15:09,560 --> 04:15:10,440
I want...

3974
04:15:10,440 --> 04:15:11,660
Oh, that's the one I already...

3975
04:15:11,660 --> 04:15:16,760
Oh, this place is going to be a nightmare, because you can't tell where you've been, because it's all dark.

3976
04:15:24,330 --> 04:15:25,090
It's really annoying.

3977
04:15:38,140 --> 04:15:38,740
Oh, shit!

3978
04:15:41,890 --> 04:15:42,310
That was scary.

3979
04:15:55,070 --> 04:15:55,750
There we go.

3980
04:15:56,870 --> 04:15:58,730
There's going to be so much blood here.

3981
04:16:13,120 --> 04:16:14,260
Explode that one.

3982
04:16:22,580 --> 04:16:23,780
Grab some...

3983
04:16:24,380 --> 04:16:24,900
There we go.

3984
04:16:31,180 --> 04:16:31,260
Oh!

3985
04:16:32,600 --> 04:16:33,160
Is that it?

3986
04:16:34,740 --> 04:16:35,660
What's happening there?

3987
04:16:40,460 --> 04:16:40,740
Nice!

3988
04:16:44,320 --> 04:16:45,900
Dude, I am swimming in health.

3989
04:16:50,120 --> 04:16:50,720
Completely.

3990
04:17:08,520 --> 04:17:08,900
Okay.

3991
04:17:10,260 --> 04:17:11,600
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

3992
04:17:11,600 --> 04:17:13,580
That did a lot of damage to me.

3993
04:17:31,020 --> 04:17:32,240
Gotta heal up.

3994
04:17:39,450 --> 04:17:40,010
Oh, shit!

3995
04:17:40,290 --> 04:17:40,750
I didn't see it!

3996
04:17:41,130 --> 04:17:41,810
What the fuck?

3997
04:17:41,930 --> 04:17:42,570
That was so hidden!

3998
04:17:44,130 --> 04:17:44,470
What?

3999
04:17:45,830 --> 04:17:46,290
Goddamn!

4000
04:17:48,770 --> 04:17:50,530
I did not see that at all.

4001
04:17:55,800 --> 04:17:57,780
This is why I gotta stay topped up, man.

4002
04:17:58,680 --> 04:17:59,820
That could have been a disaster.

4003
04:18:06,310 --> 04:18:07,930
Get some more HP as well.

4004
04:18:11,950 --> 04:18:12,950
Full health, nice.

4005
04:18:14,110 --> 04:18:17,060
Make a little nice hole for the blood so I can pick it up.

4006
04:18:34,260 --> 04:18:34,920
Oh, I see.

4007
04:18:35,040 --> 04:18:35,920
Oh, it's hidden there.

4008
04:18:36,040 --> 04:18:36,440
You see that?

4009
04:18:39,300 --> 04:18:40,460
Could have been real bad.

4010
04:18:45,610 --> 04:18:46,830
I can't tell if I've been here.

4011
04:18:47,310 --> 04:18:49,590
I mean, if I see destruction and shit, then I know I've been there.

4012
04:18:50,050 --> 04:18:51,170
If not, I have no clue.

4013
04:19:14,380 --> 04:19:17,160
And I guess if there's enemies, it's a good indicator too.

4014
04:19:38,760 --> 04:19:39,100
Bastard!

4015
04:19:39,420 --> 04:19:40,280
I tried to escape his shot.

4016
04:19:57,960 --> 04:19:58,960
This is insane!

4017
04:20:01,680 --> 04:20:04,780
This is absolutely just ideal for my vampirism.

4018
04:20:17,180 --> 04:20:18,200
Oh, I still need to find water.

4019
04:20:28,260 --> 04:20:31,680
And the good news about being bloody all the time is I get crit, right?

4020
04:20:40,400 --> 04:20:43,420
Man, this guy is really just hidden there.

4021
04:20:46,000 --> 04:20:46,220
Ah!

4022
04:20:47,800 --> 04:20:48,920
I can't hit him!

4023
04:20:51,970 --> 04:20:53,150
That is so annoying!

4024
04:20:53,150 --> 04:20:53,870
Oh,

4025
04:21:00,130 --> 04:21:02,130
he died finally.

4026
04:21:38,040 --> 04:21:38,460
Come on!

4027
04:21:39,340 --> 04:21:40,280
Man, where are all the wands?

4028
04:21:55,050 --> 04:21:56,090
Was his body on fire?

4029
04:22:01,140 --> 04:22:01,260
Dude!

4030
04:22:01,620 --> 04:22:01,980
Whoa!

4031
04:22:02,880 --> 04:22:03,480
Hello!

4032
04:22:04,260 --> 04:22:08,100
The energy orb is insane at carving up enemies!

4033
04:22:09,140 --> 04:22:10,340
That's my new go-to!

4034
04:22:13,600 --> 04:22:14,620
It's so good!

4035
04:22:21,510 --> 04:22:22,490
Fans, like, look at this!

4036
04:22:53,030 --> 04:22:53,470
Haha!

4037
04:22:55,790 --> 04:22:59,690
This blood coming down from above here is incredible.

4038
04:23:01,370 --> 04:23:03,350
The whole level is going to be filled with blood.

4039
04:23:12,920 --> 04:23:14,160
All the liquids together.

4040
04:23:14,660 --> 04:23:14,940
Come on.

4041
04:23:16,480 --> 04:23:17,160
And that's the edge!

4042
04:23:35,090 --> 04:23:35,530
Okay.

4043
04:23:35,890 --> 04:23:36,830
Also, I should grab some water.

4044
04:23:37,510 --> 04:23:37,850
Since I'm here.

4045
04:23:47,360 --> 04:23:49,120
Oh yeah, look at all these liquids.

4046
04:23:52,720 --> 04:23:54,460
I think I should just move on.

4047
04:23:55,260 --> 04:23:58,540
This level is kind of a disaster to try and figure out where I've been.

4048
04:24:01,560 --> 04:24:02,040
No, hold on!

4049
04:24:02,280 --> 04:24:02,480
Hold on.

4050
04:24:03,540 --> 04:24:07,480
We still have the part above the shop.

4051
04:24:18,030 --> 04:24:18,530
Oh, please die.

4052
04:24:20,250 --> 04:24:20,690
Oh shit!

4053
04:24:31,450 --> 04:24:32,710
There's so much blood!

4054
04:24:34,550 --> 04:24:35,290
God damn!

4055
04:24:49,000 --> 04:24:53,340
I'm kind of scared of going back to the hourglass thing, though.

4056
04:24:53,820 --> 04:24:55,820
Because of the scare I got last time.

4057
04:24:55,920 --> 04:24:56,300
Whoa!

4058
04:25:04,620 --> 04:25:06,180
I guess this means I haven't been here.

4059
04:25:07,260 --> 04:25:07,780
Because there's enemies.

4060
04:25:09,000 --> 04:25:09,100
Oops.

4061
04:25:20,180 --> 04:25:20,820
It's a portal.

4062
04:25:21,660 --> 04:25:22,560
With even more blood.

4063
04:25:30,280 --> 04:25:33,340
Is it just me, or has this run been extremely stingy?

4064
04:25:33,760 --> 04:25:34,140
With hearts.

4065
04:25:35,280 --> 04:25:39,980
Like, I have spent an absurd amount of time exploring every region I've been in.

4066
04:25:40,180 --> 04:25:41,400
And I've found so little.

4067
04:25:44,950 --> 04:25:47,030
Like, they just won't want to give them out.

4068
04:25:50,850 --> 04:25:52,610
Oh, I'm full on blood.

4069
04:25:55,290 --> 04:25:58,530
At least, note for the future, if I ever want to heal, just come back to a easy base.

4070
04:25:59,930 --> 04:26:01,430
There's pretty much infinite healing here.

4071
04:26:03,370 --> 04:26:04,830
Oh, hold on, that's electrified.

4072
04:26:06,770 --> 04:26:07,110
Right.

4073
04:26:11,680 --> 04:26:12,660
You know what, I'm gonna...

4074
04:26:12,660 --> 04:26:13,220
Oh, no, no, no.

4075
04:26:14,080 --> 04:26:14,760
Just leave it.

4076
04:26:16,320 --> 04:26:16,840
Play it safe.

4077
04:26:18,720 --> 04:26:19,520
Okay, so I've been here.

4078
04:26:20,020 --> 04:26:20,520
That's clear.

4079
04:26:24,270 --> 04:26:25,210
Yeah, I think it's time to leave.

4080
04:26:26,270 --> 04:26:26,470
Hold on.

4081
04:26:27,870 --> 04:26:28,770
Quick look up here.

4082
04:26:29,430 --> 04:26:29,770
Oh, I've been here.

4083
04:26:30,470 --> 04:26:31,170
Let's get out of here.

4084
04:26:41,500 --> 04:26:43,580
I forgot to...

4085
04:26:46,010 --> 04:26:47,270
I forgot my black hole.

4086
04:26:51,350 --> 04:26:52,890
Get rid of these.

4087
04:26:56,030 --> 04:26:56,830
And...

4088
04:26:56,830 --> 04:26:57,190
What do we got?

4089
04:26:58,550 --> 04:26:58,830
Okay.

4090
04:27:03,090 --> 04:27:03,630
All right.

4091
04:27:05,110 --> 04:27:06,770
Nothing extremely enticing.

4092
04:27:10,230 --> 04:27:10,590
Ooh.

4093
04:27:13,330 --> 04:27:13,610
Toxic immunity.

4094
04:27:18,260 --> 04:27:21,100
I wonder if that works against toxic rock.

4095
04:27:22,720 --> 04:27:24,780
It does say, and other toxic things.

4096
04:27:25,900 --> 04:27:26,300
Right?

4097
04:27:30,630 --> 04:27:31,990
I feel like I want to be greedy.

4098
04:27:32,170 --> 04:27:33,030
I have so much money.

4099
04:27:36,150 --> 04:27:36,450
Reroll.

4100
04:27:37,090 --> 04:27:37,430
Hey!

4101
04:27:38,610 --> 04:27:39,330
Fire immunity.

4102
04:27:45,670 --> 04:27:46,710
Yeah, definitely.

4103
04:27:48,030 --> 04:27:48,410
Definitely.

4104
04:27:53,690 --> 04:27:54,090
Okay.

4105
04:27:55,770 --> 04:27:56,610
All right.

4106
04:27:57,350 --> 04:27:58,170
Things are looking good.

4107
04:27:59,430 --> 04:28:02,930
Now I just need to find just a tiny bit better...

4108
04:28:03,470 --> 04:28:04,630
Also, I may get rid of the light.

4109
04:28:06,570 --> 04:28:08,110
Just because I want to...

4110
04:28:10,150 --> 04:28:11,950
have more speed on this.

4111
04:28:16,450 --> 04:28:16,770
Yeah.

4112
04:28:17,370 --> 04:28:19,450
It's going to be nice in the shooting through liquids as well.

4113
04:28:20,530 --> 04:28:21,350
Oh, I'm sorry, fishies.

4114
04:28:21,970 --> 04:28:22,570
Actually, I'm not sorry.

4115
04:28:22,830 --> 04:28:23,230
Fuck you.

4116
04:28:24,590 --> 04:28:26,090
It's a way to generate some blood, I guess.

4117
04:28:26,290 --> 04:28:27,130
I never thought about that.

4118
04:28:28,210 --> 04:28:29,230
